WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.842 --> 00:00:16.309
It was the day of tryouts.

2
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:24.722
Eddy saw Zippy.

3
00:00:24.723 --> 00:00:33.804
He saw other cars too.

4
00:00:33.805 --> 00:00:43.274
They all looked pretty fast.

5
00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:47.341
"Welcome to tryouts," said Mr. Grill.

6
00:00:47.342 --> 00:00:52.687
"I need four fast racers."

7
00:00:52.688 --> 00:00:56.344
"How will you pick them?" Zippy asked.

8
00:00:56.345 --> 00:00:59.774
"We'll have a race," said Mr. Grill.

9
00:00:59.775 --> 00:01:04.021
"I'll pick the four winners."

10
00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:07.761
"Me!" said Zippy.

11
00:01:07.762 --> 00:01:10.926
"Maybe," said Mr. Grill.

12
00:01:10.927 --> 00:01:16.121
"Everyone, line up."

13
00:01:16.122 --> 00:01:20.922
Eddy went to the starting line.

14
00:01:20.923 --> 00:01:24.932
He was between two big cars.

15
00:01:24.933 --> 00:01:28.594
Their engines rumbled.

16
00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:31.895
Eddy gulped.

17
00:01:31.896 --> 00:01:36.258
But then he heard his friends.

18
00:01:36.259 --> 00:01:42.809
"You can do it, Eddy!" Poppy shouted.

19
00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:46.891
"Good luck, everyone," said Mr. Grill.

20
00:01:46.892 --> 00:01:51.107
"Ready, set . . . go!"

21
00:01:51.108 --> 00:01:55.300
Eddy took off.

22
00:01:55.301 --> 00:01:58.393
"I can do this," he thought.

23
00:01:58.394 --> 00:02:04.542
"I can make the team!"
